261	// ---- definition parsing ---------------------------------------------------
262	
263	// parseDefinitionJSON parses and fully validates a definition document
264	// against the version's declared counts.
265	//
266	// Rejected inputs include malformed JSON, trailing data, duplicate/unknown
267	// or missing fields (top level, per constraint and per term), a non-prime or
